flowchart TB
    accTitle: When the schedules of a repository run
    accDescr: The blueprint has slot 0, a repository of the registry its place in the Rollout, any other repository a slot from the hash of its owner and name. Each weekly schedule moves by as many days, every schedule by 8 minutes for each within its hour, so the heavy weekly jobs of two repositories never share an hour of a day.

    blueprint["The blueprint<br>slot 0, its own times"]
    fleet["A repository of .github/fleet.toml<br>slot = its place in the Rollout, 1 to 6"]
    other["Any other repository<br>slot = hash of owner/name, 0 to 27"]
    move["includes/replace.jinja moves each schedule<br>weekly: slot days later<br>every one: 8 × slot minutes later, within its hour"]
    result["The heavy weekly jobs of two repositories<br>never share an hour of a day"]

    blueprint --> move
    fleet --> move
    other --> move
    move --> result

